# IAP offer popups (named)

**Starter Pack popup** → `components/StarterPackPopup.tsx` (wraps `IapOfferPopup`).  
**Field Pack popup** → `components/FieldPackPopup.tsx` (wraps `IapOfferPopup`).  
**Remove Ads popup** → `IapOfferPopup` directly with red chrome.  

Shared shell: `components/IapOfferPopup.tsx` (premium top band + header ring). Post-purchase confirmation stays **`PurchaseSuccessfulPopup`** (plain cream).

| Name (when talking to the AI) | Component | `offerId` constant | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Starter Pack popup** | `StarterPackPopup` | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_STARTER_PACK_ID` | Garden 1 level 4; purple chrome |
| **Field Pack popup** | `FieldPackPopup` | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_FIELD_PACK_ID` | Garden 2+ level 4; own title/icon/FB |
| **Remove Ads popup** | `IapOfferPopup` | `STORE_IAP_OFFER_REMOVE_ADS_ID` | Red band / `popup_header_red.png` |

- **State:** `iapOfferUi` in `App.tsx` — `setIapOfferUi({ offerId: … })`.
- **Farm floating buttons:**
  - Garden 1 → `FloatingButtonStarterPack` → Starter Pack popup
  - Garden 2+ → `FloatingButtonFieldPack` → Field Pack popup (`icon_fb_fieldpack.png`)
  - NO ADS → Remove Ads popup
- Never show Starter Pack FB on garden 2+ (or Field Pack FB on garden 1), even if the other offer is still unlocked.
- **Leaf burst:** Starter / Field Pack use purple leaves; Remove Ads uses red.
